                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "We booked the Eatogether Xinyi Restaurant buffet for New Year celebrations and hoped to see the fireworks from 101. However, our table could not see the view, but it was okay as we wanted to avoid the crowd. We arrived at the restaurant quite early because some roads were blocked. The reception staff was not very helpful, maybe she was tired. The lobster was served individually and the food was fresh. I really enjoyed the salmon. Even though there was a long queue, everything moved quite fast. Most of the staff were nice and cleared plates quickly. After dinner, we walked down and could see the fireworks very clearly. It was beautiful and enjoyable. 😊",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
